        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ammo Bounce</strong> is a <strong>high-adrenaline, neon-drenched reinvention</strong> of the classic brick breaker — but this time, forget the ball. You’re unleashing a <strong>spinning buzzsaw of destruction</strong> that carves through anything standing in its way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> take command of the deflector platform and turn every bounce into a burst of chaos. Hurl your deadly saw against relentless waves of enemies and destructible obstacles. But beware — not all foes are easy targets. Some dodge unpredictably, others are shielded on multiple sides, and a few cunning ones even <strong>build barriers in real time</strong> to block your attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your timing, master ricochets, and <strong>embrace controlled mayhem</strong> as you collect powerful upgrades mid-battle. Add extra saws, widen your platform, or trigger temporary boosts to dominate the arena — but choose wisely. Certain items can shrink your paddle, steal your weapon, or even cost you a precious life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive, fast, and intensely satisfying, every stage of <strong>Ammo Bounce</strong> transforms into a glowing arena of <strong>metal, reflexes, and chaos</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 A brutal evolution of the brick breaker genre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Wield a lethal <strong>buzzsaw</strong> instead of a ball — slice, ricochet, and destroy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Power-ups and traps that reshape each match in seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Enemies with unique tactics: unpredictable movement, heavy armor, or instant barriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Electric soundtrack and vivid <strong>cyber-neon visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
